  "semantic": {
    "lines": [
      "Have you heard of specialized items?",
      "A specialized item provides higher performance when used by",
      "a character of a certain tribe. The required skill abilities",
      "differ between specialized items and unspecialized items, and",
      "each specialized item's performance also differs.",
      "You can identify a specialized item by the notes specifying",
      "specialized quality under the specifications of the item ",
      "with added skill abilities. ",
      "",
